{"id":67507,"date":"2025-09-06T12:20:16","date_gmt":"2025-09-06T11:20:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67507"},"modified":"2026-09-27T23:49:11","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T22:49:11","slug":"corrida-s-s-manuel-dos-santos-almeida","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-s-s-manuel-dos-santos-almeida\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Manuel dos Santos Almeida 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Manuel dos Santos Almeida 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Manuel dos Santos Almeida 2026<\/strong> (12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>19 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> na acolhedora est\u00e2ncia termal de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Co-organizada pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul<\/strong>, pela <strong>Termalistur EM<\/strong> e pela <strong>Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de S. Pedro do Sul, V\u00e1rzea e Bai\u00f5es<\/strong>, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico do GTT \u2013 Grupo Todo Terreno, a prova homenageia a incontorn\u00e1vel figura desportiva Manuel dos Santos Almeida e junta atletas e amantes do desporto na <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s 17:30 com a participativa <strong>Caminhada<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s 19:00 o tiro de partida da competitiva <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (10.000 metros) que liga S\u00e3o Pedro do Sul ao hist\u00f3rico complexo das Termas e regresso ao centro urbano. Cronometrada pela <strong>Stop and Go<\/strong> com chip eletr\u00f3nico, a corrida oferece pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aliciantes para a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral e escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, vouchers termais, medalha de finisher e t-shirt comemorativa para os inscritos at\u00e9 30 de novembro.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong>